category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libcmocka-devel libcrypt-devel libcurl-devel libssh-devel libssl-devel libyang-devel
sdesc: "NETCONF library in C intended for building NETCONF clients and servers (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libnetconf2 is a NETCONF library in C intended for building NETCONF clients
and servers. NETCONF is the NETwork CONFiguration protocol introduced by IETF."
